# A new game on a wide screen of 852x480 (fixtures/widenew: the CD's
# LBA.CFG with WideScreen: ON, recorded with -D 1920x1080): its name
# typed in the window in the middle, the introduction's pictures in the
# window and its text, the movie, in mode 13h, in the window's place in
# 4:3, bars beside it, cut short, then the cell on the whole screen and
# F5's zoom in 4:3 as the movie.
sleep 40
shot menu
key Return
sleep 4
shot name
key a b c
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 6
shot text
key Escape
sleep 8
shot movie
key Escape
sleep 10
shot scene
key F5
sleep 3
shot zoom
key F5
sleep 3
shot unzoom
